{"id":"fcf8e66483555f57","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-so-sentence.md","title":"Second-Order Sentence","display":"df-so-sentence — Second-Order Sentence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-so-sentence","aliases":["57-df-so-sentence"],"display":"df-so-sentence — Second-Order Sentence","depends_on":["[[57-df-so-formula]]","[[57-df-so-var]]","[[57-df-var-in-term]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-so-sentence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-so-sentence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-so-sentence — Second-Order Sentence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"433037f9b53db530\" href=\"?note=433037f9b53db530\" title=\"57-df-so-formula\">57-df-so-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d06cd82e12837aa5\" href=\"?note=d06cd82e12837aa5\" title=\"57-df-so-var\">57-df-so-var</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"16a587bb999452b8\" href=\"?note=16a587bb999452b8\" title=\"57-df-var-in-term\">57-df-var-in-term</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2\">\\(X\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}\\)</span>。项变量函数取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"16a587bb999452b8\" href=\"?note=16a587bb999452b8\" title=\"57-df-var-in-term\">57-df-var-in-term</a>。保留原接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S^2\\)</span> “无自由一阶变量”的非标准约定；另以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FullSent}_S^2\">\\(\\mathrm{FullSent}_S^2\\)</span> 表示两类变量都无自由出现的公式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}\">\\(\\mathrm{free}\\)</span> 在二阶公式上的扩展由下式递归定义，不把一阶函数直接应用于定义域外。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\">\\(R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\">\\(\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{free}(s\\doteq t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{var}(s)\\cup\\mathrm{var}(t),&amp;\n\\mathrm{free}^2(s\\doteq t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\emptyset,\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(R(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_i\\mathrm{var}(t_i),&amp;\n\\mathrm{free}^2(R(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\emptyset,\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(X(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_i\\mathrm{var}(t_i),&amp;\n\\mathrm{free}^2(X(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\{X\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi),&amp;\n\\mathrm{free}^2(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}^2(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{free}(\\psi),&amp;\n\\mathrm{free}^2(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}^2(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{free}^2(\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(Qx\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\},&amp;\n\\mathrm{free}^2(Qx\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}^2(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(QX\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi),&amp;\n\\mathrm{free}^2(QX\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}^2(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{X\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{free}(s\\doteq t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{var}(s)\\cup\\mathrm{var}(t),&amp;\n\\mathrm{free}^2(s\\doteq t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\emptyset,\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(R(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_i\\mathrm{var}(t_i),&amp;\n\\mathrm{free}^2(R(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\emptyset,\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(X(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_i\\mathrm{var}(t_i),&amp;\n\\mathrm{free}^2(X(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\{X\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi),&amp;\n\\mathrm{free}^2(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}^2(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{free}(\\psi),&amp;\n\\mathrm{free}^2(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}^2(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{free}^2(\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(Qx\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\},&amp;\n\\mathrm{free}^2(Qx\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}^2(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(QX\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi),&amp;\n\\mathrm{free}^2(QX\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}^2(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{X\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S^2\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2:\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)=\\emptyset\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{FullSent}_S^2\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S^2:\\mathrm{free}^2(\\varphi)=\\emptyset\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sent}_S^2\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2:\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)=\\emptyset\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{FullSent}_S^2\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S^2:\\mathrm{free}^2(\\varphi)=\\emptyset\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>不改变 Sent² 的已有对象。只有 FullSent² 才同时独立于两类赋值；将模型级后承简化应用于 Sent² 全体会产生错误。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-so-formula","status":"resolved","id":"433037f9b53db530","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-so-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-so-var","status":"resolved","id":"d06cd82e12837aa5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-so-var]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-var-in-term","status":"resolved","id":"16a587bb999452b8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-var-in-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-var-in-term","status":"resolved","id":"16a587bb999452b8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2$，$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$，$X\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2$，$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}$，$\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}$。项变量函数取 [[57-df-var-in-term]]。保留原接口 $\\mathrm{Sent}_S^2$ “无自由一阶变量”的非标准约定；另以 $\\mathrm{FullSent}_S^2$ 表示两类变量都无自由出现的公式。$\\mathrm{free}$ 在二阶公式上的扩展由下式递归定义，不把一阶函数直接应用于定义域外。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_S^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FullSent}_S^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{free}","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{free}(s\\doteq t)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{var}(s)\\cup\\mathrm{var}(t),&\n\\mathrm{free}^2(s\\doteq t)&\\coloneqq\\emptyset,\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(R(\\vec t))&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_i\\mathrm{var}(t_i),&\n\\mathrm{free}^2(R(\\vec t))&\\coloneqq\\emptyset,\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(X(\\vec t))&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_i\\mathrm{var}(t_i),&\n\\mathrm{free}^2(X(\\vec t))&\\coloneqq\\{X\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(\\neg\\varphi)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi),&\n\\mathrm{free}^2(\\neg\\varphi)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}^2(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{free}(\\psi),&\n\\mathrm{free}^2(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}^2(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{free}^2(\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(Qx\\varphi)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\},&\n\\mathrm{free}^2(Qx\\varphi)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}^2(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{free}(QX\\varphi)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi),&\n\\mathrm{free}^2(QX\\varphi)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{free}^2(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{X\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_S^2\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2:\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)=\\emptyset\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{FullSent}_S^2\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S^2:\\mathrm{free}^2(\\varphi)=\\emptyset\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2215,"backlinks":[{"id":"74427ffce2add3bd","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2$，$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2$；满足与赋值取 [[57-df-so-semantics]]。$\\mathrm{FullSent}_S^2$ 取 [[57-df-so-sentence]]；其条件不同于原 $\\mathrm{Sent}_S^2$。"},{"id":"f6ad1f8f52dadb89","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"521852a49020f617","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6d139079451cd2a7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"exce